\subsection{Research attempt}
\paragraph{Model, date and investigated scope.}
OpenAI GPT-6 Astra (configured model \texttt{gpt-6-astra}), ultra reasoning; generated 11 October 2026. Constructed a strongly continuous projective translation/modulation representation and verified its cocycle coherence and central extension.

\paragraph{Sources and literature check.}
Read the full supplied definition, catalogue wording, source qualifications and listed references for 30006633. No fresh status or novelty search was performed. The argument below proves its auxiliary statements directly and does not import an unverified external theorem.

\paragraph{Continuous symmetries already need coherence data.} On \(L^2(\mathbb R)\), define \(U(a,b)\psi(x)=e^{ibx}\psi(x+a)\), for real \(a,b\). These operators are unitary. Continuity on compactly supported smooth functions follows by dominated convergence and uniform continuity; density and the unitary norm bound extend strong continuity to every \(L^2\) vector. Direct multiplication gives
\[
 U(a,b)U(a',b')=e^{iab'}U(a+a',b+b').
\]
Thus the additive group \(\mathbb R^2\) acts projectively, with continuous scalar comparison \(c(g,h)=e^{iab'}\), where \(g=(a,b)\), \(h=(a',b')\).
\paragraph{Associativity becomes a coherence equation.} For \(k=(a'',b'')\),
\[
 c(g,h)c(g+h,k)
 =e^{i(ab'+ab''+a'b'')}
 =c(h,k)c(g,h+k).
\]
This is exactly the consistency of the two triple-product parenthesizations. It permits the honest central extension with multiplication \((g,z)(h,w)=(g+h,zwc(g,h))\). Translation and modulation also have commutator phase \(e^{iab}\), which a discrete list of symmetry labels would fail to record.
\paragraph{Scope and source gap.} This is an elementary continuous/projective representation test, not a higher-categorical model of the source QFTs. It identifies a minimal scalar two-morphism and topology that a proposed framework must recover. Defect fusion, higher junctions, local observable actions and spacetime covariance require additional levels of data, and the physically relevant central phases may depend on the theory. The first gap is a functorial construction attaching those coherent structures to actual field theories and matching both their internal and geometric symmetry actions.

\paragraph{Verification and adversarial audit.}
Checked unitarity, strong continuity by density, the phase multiplication, both associativity factors and the distinction between scalar projective coherence and the full higher programme. Model self-audit only; no independent human mathematical verification. Applied contribution prompt A before drafting and B afterwards. Checked unitarity, strong continuity by density, the phase multiplication, both associativity factors and the distinction between scalar projective coherence and the full higher programme. First remaining gap: Build a functorial QFT defect/junction framework whose continuous higher data reproduce both internal actions and spacetime covariance. The inherited source status is preserved; original-target completion remains zero.

Coordinator checked the strongly continuous translation-modulation representation, projective multiplier and cocycle identity. This additional check was model-assisted, not independent human verification.

\paragraph{Tools, process and contributions.}
Python 3 and local file tools used to read definitions and serialize manuscripts. Calculations are symbolic reasoning; no numerical experiment or theorem prover. Contribution prompt A was followed by prompt B. GPT-6 Astra with ultra reasoning drafted the research and performed its stated self-audit; any additional coordinator contribution is identified in the verification and audit. A GPT-6-based Codex coordinator assembled the manuscript and checked repository integration; its exact variant and reasoning configuration were not exposed. No human mathematical contribution, independent human proof check or formal proof certification is supplied. Complete derivations and the consulted source references are included here; private reasoning transcripts are not published.

\paragraph{Final status and first remaining gap.}
\textbf{UNRESOLVED}. Build a functorial QFT defect/junction framework whose continuous higher data reproduce both internal actions and spacetime covariance.

